<title>SPAIN: Spain's Zaragozano Q1 profit up 26.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Zaragozano Q1 profit up 26.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaragozano banking group, three months to March 31 results (billion pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p> Net interest income		   5.53   vs     5.42</p>
<p> Ordinary margin			 8.47   vs     7.20</p>
<p> Operating margin			2.35   vs     1.37</p>
<p> Pretax profit			   1.50   vs     1.13</p>
<p> Net attributable profit	     1.03   vs     0.82</p>
</text>
